export anchor WheatpastePosterStyle:
    number: 156
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Wheatpaste poster
    idea: A street wall of pasted posters, torn and overlapping, where each part of the dashboard is its own bill in huge condensed capitals and flat ink colours.
    base: light
    palette:
        wall: #d9d3c8, the brick wall page
        mortar: #c7c0b3, brick joint lines only
        poster: #f7f4ec, white bills and fields
        yellow: #f3d23a, the greeting bill, At risk tags and the active nav item
        pink: #f4b3c2, the chart bill and one number bill
        red: #b0161f, the primary button, due dates, the overdue bill, Behind and this week bars
        blue: #1b3a8c, the focus outline only
        black: #111111, type, the header strip, On track tags and last week bars
        grey: #4d4a44, small notes
    type:
        Display uses Arial Narrow, Roboto Condensed, Helvetica Neue
        Condensed, Liberation Sans Narrow, Nimbus Sans Narrow, Arial,
        sans-serif in bold condensed caps. The greeting runs 56 to 128px
        at 0.82 line height, numbers 92px, section heads 54px, project
        names 26 to 40px, tags and labels 17 to 22px. Body uses Helvetica
        Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif at 15 to 16px.
    layout:
        A long black strip poster across the top with a yellow wordmark,
        nav words split by slashes with Home on a yellow block, then a
        cream search, red New project, a yellow bell count and the name in
        caps. Below, a twelve column wall with no gutters where bills
        overlap by 10 to 30px and tilt half to two degrees. A huge yellow
        bill on the left says Morning, Mara with the date above and a
        black overdue band with a stop octagon. Four small number bills in
        a two by two series to its right, white, pink, red and white. A
        white gig bill lists the six projects as acts with the name huge
        on the left, the due date in red on the right, then a tag, the
        facts and ten square progress boxes. To the right a white flyer
        lists activity and ends in vertical tear-off tabs with one tab
        missing, and a pink chart bill shows flat black and red bars. Each
        bill has one torn edge cut by a clip path. Below 1000px everything
        stacks in one column.
    spacing: Bills butt together with no gutter and overlap by 10 to 30px. Inside, 22 to 30px padding.
    density: Loud and big. Few words per bill, set huge, with the facts in one small line underneath.
    corners: Square paper with torn jagged edges on one side of each bill.
    borders: None on bills. Thick 6px black rules head lists, 2px rules split rows, dashed lines mark tear-off tabs.
    shadows: None. Pasted paper lies flat with faint diagonal sheen and wrinkle lines.
    icons:
        Solid printed shapes inside caps tags. A circle on black means On
        track, a triangle on yellow means At risk, a square on red means
        Behind, and a yellow stop octagon with a bang marks overdue.
    focus: A 4px blue outline offset 3px. Inside the black header the search gets a yellow outline.
    tone: Gig bill shouting, such as Now playing, Latest, Done daily and Morning Mara.
